    54→
    55→// ─── Dynamic State Renderer ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
    56→
    57→/**
    58→ * Renders the live conversation state as a formatted instruction section.
    59→ * Appended to the base policy instruction so OpenAI always has an up-to-date
