   214→        `Build a genuine human connection with ${callerName} before any business talk.`,
   215→        `Ask ONE light, personal question — about their day, their role, or something they mentioned.`,
   216→        `Do NOT mention ${product} or the campaign goal ("${goal}") at this stage.`,
   217→        `After asking — STOP and wait for their answer.`,
   218→      ].join(' ');
