   234→      return [
   235→        `You have captured ${mem.painPoints.length} pain point(s): ${painList}.`,
   236→        `Either dig deeper with a follow-up question, or confirm understanding and`,
   237→        `move to Qualification when you are confident you understand their real need.`,
