   499→   *
   500→   * Evidence: live runtime test against wss://api.openai.com/v1/realtime?model=gpt-realtime
   501→   *   - 'audio/pcmu' accepted for G.711 µ-law (telephony)
   502→   *   - 'audio/pcma' accepted for G.711 A-law (telephony)
   503→   *   - 'audio/pcm'  accepted for raw PCM
   504→   *   - 'audio/g711-ulaw' rejected (invalid_value)
   505→   *   - format.rate field rejected (unknown_parameter)
